From: Pierre-Louis Bossart <pierre-louis.bossart@linux.intel.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Feb 2024 12:12:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: SOF: topology: dynamically allocate and store DAI
 widget->private
MIME-Version: 1.0
